    skos:topConceptOf <https://geo-carto.github.io/vocabularios/geomorfologia-tipo-natural> ;
    adms:status "Válido" .

<https://geo-carto.github.io/vocabularios/geomorfologia-tipo-natural/objeto-geomorfologico-natural> a skos:Concept ;
